  62+ 6C90 DD CB 00 46      bit  $00, (ix)
  63+ 6C94 C8               ret  z
  64+ 6C95
  65+ 6C95 DD CB 00 86      res  $00, (ix)
  66+ 6C99
  67+ 6C99 ED 4B 89 93      ld   bc, (PlayerPos)
