  51+ 7DCC 32 AF 96         ld   (current_room), a
  52+ 7DCF
  53+ 7DCF C1               pop  bc
  54+ 7DD0 D1               pop  de
  55+ 7DD1 E1               pop  hl
  56+ 7DD2 C9               ret
